entries[974] = { ["name"] = "Earth Shield", ["text"] = "5% of base mana 40 yd range\nInstant\nProtects the target with an earthen shield, increasing your healing on them by 20% and healing them for [(73% of Spell Power) * (1.2)] when they take damage. This heal can only occur once every 3 sec. Maximum 9 charges .\n\n[ Elemental Orbit : Earth Shield can only be placed on the Shaman and one other target at a time. The Shaman can have up to two Elemental Shields active on them / Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time. Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman.](3s cooldown)" }
entries[980] = { ["name"] = "Agony", ["text"] = "1% of base mana 40 yd range\nInstant\nInflicts increasing agony on the target, causing up to [(3.01508% of Spell Power) * 18 / 2 * 6] Shadow damage over 18 sec. Damage starts low and increases over the duration. Refreshing Agony maintains its current damage level.\n\nAgony damage sometimes generates 1 Soul Shard." }
